Adaptation: Converted the generic refactoring command into a read-only Broken
Engine analysis and planning workflow. Specialized its checks for C++ and
data-oriented design, hot-path allocations, flags, aligned math, workbuffers,
layer boundaries, client/server guards, and repository review routing.

